TI  - Time after time: failure to identify and support females with ADHD – a Swedish population register study
PY  - 2024
T2  - Journal of Child Psychology and Psychiatry and Allied Disciplines
VL  - 65
IS  - 6
SP  - 832
EP  - 844
DO  - 10.1111/jcpp.13920
