TI  - Comparison of ADHD (Attention deficit hyperactivity disorder) prevalence between female and male students of primary schools in Arak city in academic year of 2009-2010
PY  - 2011
T2  - Scientific Journal of Kurdistan University of Medical Sciences
VL  - 16
IS  - 2
